[Safe] ALTER TYPE public.ty RENAME TO "Ty"
[Safe] ALTER TYPE public."Ty" SET SCHEMA app
[Safe] ALTER TYPE app."Ty" RENAME VALUE 'b' TO 'B'
[Safe non-tx] ALTER TYPE app."Ty" ADD VALUE 'c' AFTER 'B'  -- PG 12 öncesinde transaction dışında çalışır
[Safe] COMMENT ON TYPE app."Ty" IS NULL
[Safe] ALTER TYPE app."Ty" OWNER TO r
